  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fryshuset Foundation CSO strategy 2025-2028 - Stiftelsen Fryshuset CSO strategi 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Stiftelsen Fryshuset CSO strategi 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka unga s&#xe5; att de, genom sina passioner, kan f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra v&#xe4;rlden. Genom att skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r delaktighet, utveckling och v&#xe4;lm&#xe5;ende blir unga aktiva samh&#xe4;llsbyggare som driver h&#xe5;llbar, inkluderande och positiv f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to empower young people so that they can change the world through their passions. By creating conditions for participation, development, and well-being, young people become active community builders who drive sustainable, inclusive, and positive change.</narrative>
  </description>
